      "created_at": "2016-09-15T14:07:20.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Unless Guise is playing the card with that icon &nbsp;I don't believe that he should activate any affects on a one-shot played by the Naturalist. &nbsp;In regards to Indomitable Force unless Guise has copied t through Uh,Yeah, I'm That Guy! and then uses I Can Do That Too! again to become a rhino he wouldn't get the added ability of redirecting the damage. &nbsp;</p>",
