      "created_at": "2016-09-15T14:35:00.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Hmmm.</p><p>I'm of the opinion that just because Guise is an [animal] doesn't mean he gets to activate the effects on other people's cards. I think Desperate Prey is a null power for him (though forcing the redirect to The Naturalist when he wasn't in Rhino form is good shenanigans, if not how I would play it).</p><p>I have nothing to back this up.</p>",
