      "created_at": "2016-09-15T17:24:58.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>So if Guise uses Desperate Prey to activate Rhino effects, and then the Naturalist (who is not activating Rhino effects) plays Threatening Stomp or something, does the Rhino clause activate?</p>",
      "post_number": 9,
      "post_type": 1,
